      "licence": "Open data, re-use of public sector information",
      "retrieved": "2026-11-11",
      "effective": "2026-05-03",
      "notes": "Bulk file. 83,051 annual report records. Employee and volunteer counts before 2021 are published as bands ('250-499') and are not used. From 2021 the Regulator collects full-time and part-time counts as integers; the employee figure here is their sum, a headcount, which is not the same measure as the average-employees figure in the Benefacts archive. Government funding is the sum of 'Income: Government or Local Authorities' and 'Income: Other Public Bodies', because charities reclassify between the two."
    },
